  "details": "When I open the old menu/main menu for avatars or safety while being in temporary pose space, the opened menu gets offset so heavily that it tends to be not usable anymore. See here a video of what is happening:\nhttps://i.gyazo.com/302c90a1edbb27a68774a3389a827d26.mp4\n(avatar is in prone with temporary pose space, it completely deforms itself)\nWe did hint about the avatar deform already here during the beta: https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1137-add-a-parameter-which-shows-if-the-menu-is-opened\nWe assumed that temporary pose space might be an issue as well here too during beta: \nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1137-custom-sitting-animation-causes-menu-placement-issue",
